  "releaseNotes": "Preview 13 adds latest-merge change-detection baselines and internal dependency version\n      propagation for temporary builds and permanent version apply runs. The corrected\n      changeDetection.includeDependents setting replaces includeDependencies, which remains a\n      deprecated alias. Version-only app.json updates now preserve all unrelated formatting,\n      comments, line endings, and characters exactly. See CHANGELOG.md for full details.",
